<title>USA: Aaron Rents Inc sets semi-annual divs.</title>
<headline>Aaron Rents Inc sets semi-annual divs.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aaron Rents Inc said it declared a semi-annual dividend on its class A common stock.</p>
<p>					Semi-annual</p>
<p>		   Latest		    Prior</p>
<p> Amount		  $0.02		     $0.02</p>
<p> Pay		    July 8</p>
<p> Record		 June 2</p>
<p>----</p>
<p>Aaron Rents Inc also said it declared a semi-annual dividend on its common stock.</p>
<p>					Semi-annual</p>
<p>		   Latest		    Prior</p>
<p> Amount		  $0.02		     $0.02</p>
<p> Pay		    July 8</p>
<p> Record		 June 2</p>
</text>
